  "title": "EgoGen and EgoM2P: Advances in Egocentric Vision",
  "summary": "EgoGen introduces a synthetic data generator that produces realistic egocentric training data for perception tasks, while EgoM2P proposes a masked modeling framework for egocentric multimodal tasks. Both projects aim to enhance immersive, first-person video understanding and enable more realistic interaction with embodied systems.",
